<title>ITALY: Italian refinery runs fell 4.5 pct Jan-Feb - UP.</title>
<headline>Italian refinery runs fell 4.5 pct Jan-Feb - UP.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian refinery runs fell 4.5 percent to 14.5 million tonnes in the first two months of 1997, according to trade body Unione Petrolifera.</p>
<p>It said crude refinery runs slipped 6.9 percent over this January-February period while imported semi-finished products rose 29.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
